---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="游戏模块 | WordsMaster"
  description="WordsMaster 游戏模块：浏览器里就能玩的小游戏，支持摄像头手势与鼠标 / 触控操作，全部本地运行。"
  keywords={['小游戏', '切水果', '体感游戏', '手势识别', '浏览器游戏']}
>
  <section class="games-page">
    <div class="games-hero">
      <h1>🎮 游戏模块</h1>
      <p>浏览器里就能玩的小游戏。支持摄像头手势识别与鼠标 / 触控板操作，全部在本地运行，无需安装。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="game-grid">
      <a class="game-card math-card" href={`${base}/games/math/`}>
        <div class="game-cover math-cover">
          <span class="cover-math math-1">🧮</span>
          <span class="cover-math math-2">➕</span>
          <span class="cover-math math-3">✖️</span>
          <span class="cover-math math-4">⭐</span>
        </div>
        <div class="game-body">
          <h2>口算大冲关 · 100以内速算</h2>
          <p>专为 1–3 年级设计的速算闯关神器：11级数段平滑晋阶、比大小智能按键、手写草稿纸与错题闭环。</p>
          <div class="game-tags">
            <span>10-100梯级</span>
            <span>比大小 & 混合</span>
            <span>手写草稿纸</span>
            <span>错题闭环</span>
          </div>
          <div class="game-cta">开始冲关 →</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="game-card fruitwave-card" href={`${base}/games/fruitwave/`}>
        <div class="game-cover fruitwave-cover">
          <div class="cover-blade-sheen"></div>
          <span class="cover-fruit fruit-1">🍉</span>
          <span class="cover-fruit fruit-2">🍓</span>
          <span class="cover-fruit fruit-3">🍍</span>
          <span class="cover-burst">✨</span>
        </div>
        <div class="game-body">
          <h2>FruitWave · 切水果</h2>
          <p>90 秒极限切水果，12 种水果等你挑战。有摄像头就伸出食指挥砍，没有摄像头用鼠标 / 触控板一样能玩。</p>
          <div class="game-tags">
            <span>手势识别</span>
            <span>鼠标 / 触控</span>
            <span>本地运行</span>
          </div>
          <div class="game-cta">开始游戏 →</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="game-card" href={`${base}/games/artcatcher/`}>
        <div class="game-cover">🧸🎁🦄</div>
        <div class="game-body">
          <h2>ArtCatcher · 3D 抓娃娃</h2>
          <p>Three.js 打造的 3D 艺术抓娃娃机：投币、操控机械爪、收集艺术手办，还有成就和图鉴等着你。</p>
          <div class="game-tags">
            <span>3D</span>
            <span>键盘 / 触屏摇杆</span>
            <span>收藏图鉴</span>
          </div>
          <div class="game-cta">开始游戏 →</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .games-hero {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .games-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .games-hero p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .game-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .game-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }

  a.game-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .game-cover {
    height: 150px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 4rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1c36, #16264a);
  }

  .game-cover.fruitwave-cover {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2), transparent 70%), linear-gradient(135deg, #091a13 0%, #10261f 50%, #1f1830 100%);
  }

  .cover-blade-sheen {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: -30%;
    width: 160%;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #34d399, #ffffff, #34d399, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px #34d399, 0 0 20px #fff;
    transform: rotate(-30deg) translateY(-50%);
    opacity: 0.75;
    animation: coverSlashSweep 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .cover-fruit {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.45));
  }
  .cover-fruit.fruit-1 {
    animation: coverFruitBob1 3.2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .cover-fruit.fruit-2 {
    animation: coverFruitBob2 2.8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .cover-fruit.fruit-3 {
    animation: coverFruitBob3 3.6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .cover-burst {
    position: absolute;
    top: 25%;
    right: 28%;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #fde047;
    animation: coverBurstPulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .game-card.fruitwave-card:hover .cover-blade-sheen {
    animation-duration: 1.5s;
    box-shadow: 0 0 22px #34d399, 0 0 35px #fff;
  }
  .game-card.fruitwave-card:hover .cover-fruit.fruit-1 {
    transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.15) rotate(-15deg);
  }
  .game-card.fruitwave-card:hover .cover-fruit.fruit-2 {
    transform: translateY(6px) scale(1.15) rotate(12deg);
  }
  .game-card.fruitwave-card:hover .cover-fruit.fruit-3 {
    transform: translateY(-10px) scale(1.15) rotate(18deg);
  }

  @keyframes coverSlashSweep {
    0%, 30% { opacity: 0; transform: rotate(-30deg) translate(-60px, -50%); }
    35% { opacity: 1; transform: rotate(-30deg) translate(0, -50%); }
    45% { opacity: 0.8; transform: rotate(-30deg) translate(80px, -50%); }
    55%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: rotate(-30deg) translate(140px, -50%); }
  }
  @keyframes coverFruitBob1 {
    0% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-8deg); }
    100% { transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(6deg) scale(1.05); }
  }
  @keyframes coverFruitBob2 {
    0% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(10deg); }
    100% { transform: translateY(6px) rotate(-6deg) scale(0.95); }
  }
  @keyframes coverFruitBob3 {
    0% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg); }
    100% { transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(12deg) scale(1.06); }
  }
  @keyframes coverBurstPulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.2; transform: scale(0.8); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); }
  }

  .game-cover.math-cover {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2), transparent 70%), linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #172554 50%, #042f2e 100%);
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
  }

  .cover-math {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
  }
  .cover-math.math-1 { animation: coverFruitBob1 3s infinite alternate; font-size: 3rem; }
  .cover-math.math-2 { animation: coverFruitBob2 2.5s infinite alternate; color: #60a5fa; }
  .cover-math.math-3 { animation: coverFruitBob3 3.2s infinite alternate; color: #34d399; }
  .cover-math.math-4 { animation: coverBurstPulse 2s infinite; color: #fbbf24; }

  .game-card.math-card:hover .cover-math.math-1 { transform: scale(1.25) rotate(-10deg); }
  .game-card.math-card:hover .cover-math.math-2 { transform: scale(1.2) translateY(-6px); }
  .game-card.math-card:hover .cover-math.math-3 { transform: scale(1.2) translateY(6px); }
  .game-card.math-card:hover .cover-math.math-4 { transform: scale(1.3) rotate(20deg); }

  .game-body {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .game-body h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .game-body p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .game-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .game-tags span {
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .game-cta {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
</style>
